<title>UK: Canada sets $450 million bond due January 2001.</title>
<headline>Canada sets $450 million bond due January 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANADA</p>
<p> AMT    $450 MLN	COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    30.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.866    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =/AA+     DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF ISSUERS PROGRAMME FOR THE ISSUANCE OF</p>
